{"id":"menyu","lemma":"меню","pos":"noun","rank":1858,"glosses":["menu"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c6/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8E.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8E.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","examples":[{"text":"Можно взглянуть на меню?","en":"May I look at the menu?","words":[{"g":"one can, one may"},{"g":"to glance at"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Пожалуйста, дайте мне меню.","en":"Please give me the menu.","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to give","l":"дать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null]},{"text":"Что сегодня в меню?","en":"What's today's menu?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"today"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Не хотите ли посмотреть на меню?","en":"Would you like to look at the menu?","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"whether (question)"},{"g":"to look"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Я смотрю, что есть в меню.","en":"I'm looking at what's on the menu.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to look, to gaze","l":"смотреть"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"in"},null]}]}